    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an e-commerce pricing analyst.\n\nAnalyze this product pricing data:\n\nProduct: {{ $json.product_name }}\nOur Price: {{ $json.our_price }}\nAverage Competitor Price: {{ $json.average_competitor_price }}\nPercentage Difference: {{ $json.percentage_difference }}%\n\nBased on these calculated values:\n\n- If our price is higher than the average competitor price, set price_position to \"higher\".\n- If our price is lower than the average competitor price, set price_position to \"lower\".\n- If our price is approximately equal to the average competitor price, set price_position to \"about the same\".\n\nDetermine:\n1. The price position.\n2. Whether the current price is competitive.\n3. A pricing recommendation.\n4. A recommended action.\n\nDo NOT recalculate the prices or percentage.\nUse the calculated values provided above.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n\n{\n  \"product_name\": \"string\",\n  \"our_price\": 0,\n  \"average_competitor_price\": 0,\n  \"price_position\": \"string\",\n  \"percentage_difference\": 0,\n  \"pricing_recommendation\": \"string\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"string\"\n}\n\nDo not include Markdown or any explanation outside the JSON.",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -112,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "6a5830df-c69a-41f1-a1e7-9764988c682a",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -112,
        96
      ],
      "id": "8e64e3c8-9c67-4f4a-b79c-285ad9d0a61b",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "IC6IM0vnBn4PHslR",
          "name": "Ollama account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const ourPrice = Number($json.our_price);\nconst competitor1 = Number($json.competitor_1_price);\nconst competitor2 = Number($json.competitor_2_price);\nconst competitor3 = Number($json.competitor_3_price);\n\nconst averageCompetitorPrice =\n  (competitor1 + competitor2 + competitor3) / 3;\n\nconst percentageDifference =\n  ((ourPrice - averageCompetitorPrice) / averageCompetitorPrice) * 100;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...$json,\n      average_competitor_price: Number(averageCompetitorPrice.toFixed(2)),\n      percentage_difference: Number(percentageDifference.toFixed(2))\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -304,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "ac19ca22-0c6e-4f92-a811-cb5679697742",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const output = $json.text;\n\nconst result = JSON.parse(output);\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: result\n  }\n];"
      },
